# A variant's field is given by position only in a call (§3.11): in braces every field is named, so
# `Ok{42}`, `Ok{(v)}` and `Ok{v}` name the call they mean. A variant without fields takes no
# arguments, and a call needs the arguments its fields do, and a bare variant an expected enum.

